{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"73.238.208.248","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80111,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2bd86f403d107fe2e11c63e163b71062","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"vancouverpetunia\"] thanks! Also, obsessed with your planning thread!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914252,"PostDate":1465350017,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281283\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281283-vancouverpetunia\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">vancouverpetunia<\/span><\/a> thanks! Also, obsessed with your planning thread!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bmillerick@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.153.133.73","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1464627188,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287040.jpg?_r=1465126901","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bmillerick","Id":287040,"Name":"bmillerick","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.232.223.153","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80111,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"13e8da3a9cd9d4454ad6a7af3b023368","RawContent":"[quote name=\"vancouverpetunia\" post=\"1914236\" timestamp=\"1465323745\"]\n@[member=\"bmillerick\"] That&#039;s hard to answer for you, as only you know your guests, their likes\/dislikes (in terms of what they would want in a resort) and your best guess at what they can afford.\n\nI think what you will find is that you will be surprised at who comes and who doesn&#039;t, and what reasons they each have for their decisions. A lot of the time it is not related to money and, when it is, some of the people you least expected to make it work will be there, while the opposite will also hold true. Advice I&#039;ve seen here many times is be reasonable with your choices, but remember it&#039;s your wedding and you can&#039;t plan it around other people. You may end up disappointed if you do.[\/quote]This is excellent advice. You must do what you want. People will surprise you with who is willing to go and who isn&#039;t. You just have to do what you want and be ready for what comes.","Attachments":[],"Id":1914291,"PostDate":1465493065,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>vancouverpetunia, on 07 June 2016 - 07:22 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287040\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/287040-bmillerick\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">bmillerick<\/span><\/a> That's hard to answer for you, as only you know your guests, their likes\/dislikes (in terms of what they would want in a resort) and your best guess at what they can afford.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I think what you will find is that you will be surprised at who comes and who doesn't, and what reasons they each have for their decisions. A lot of the time it is not related to money and, when it is, some of the people you least expected to make it work will be there, while the opposite will also hold true. Advice I've seen here many times is be reasonable with your choices, but remember it's your wedding and you can't plan it around other people. You may end up disappointed if you do.\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>This is excellent advice. You must do what you want. People will surprise you with who is willing to go and who isn't. You just have to do what you want and be ready for what comes.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mldiehl1215@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"184.6.210.243","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1460241892,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"MeredithLynne","Id":286686,"Name":"MeredithLynne","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.127.211.91","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80111,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"73b57210b1ef591ecb823935fd2b3628","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"bmillerick\"] congrats! It sounds like you are on the right path if you have a budget set! Now you need a guest list!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I would figure out how many people you want\/can afford. Ie: we can afford to have 100 people. I invited about 100, and I&#039;m personally hoping for 20-25 of that, if that gives you an idea. To me, it seems DW are a little more flexible to invite people.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I don&#039;t think you&#039;ll have an issue with a resort being able to do a DW, most resorts and hotels are able to do it. It&#039;s more a matter of, what&#039;s important to you to have or not have at the location. For me, not a beach wedding was important. Being at an all inclusive was also important. Being able to leave the resort was also important (ie: safe outside the resort). What&#039;s important to you?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914666,"PostDate":1467685086,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287040\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/287040-bmillerick\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">bmillerick<\/span><\/a> congrats! It sounds like you are on the right path if you have a budget set! Now you need a guest list!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I would figure out how many people you want\/can afford. Ie: we can afford to have 100 people. I invited about 100, and I'm personally hoping for 20-25 of that, if that gives you an idea. To me, it seems DW are a little more flexible to invite people.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I don't think you'll have an issue with a resort being able to do a DW, most resorts and hotels are able to do it. It's more a matter of, what's important to you to have or not have at the location. For me, not a beach wedding was important. Being at an all inclusive was also important. Being able to leave the resort was also important (ie: safe outside the resort). What's important to you?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"wonderlandgrl3@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"75.99.50.82","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1407877786,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279411.jpg?_r=1408152053","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mangosong","Id":279411,"Name":"Mangosong","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.149.202.99","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80111,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6cab44266377b878a921c06387c301c1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"bmillerick\"] Congrats!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Playacar palace Wow! is amazing is the best beach in town plus 5th av is a few steps away, so you can have some photos on 5th av too.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:albums:18234]&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914725,"PostDate":1467849771,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287040\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/287040-bmillerick\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">bmillerick<\/span><\/a> Congrats!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Playacar palace Wow! is amazing is the best beach in town plus 5th av is a few steps away, so you can have some photos on 5th av too.<\/p>\n<div><div class='_sharedMediaBbcode'>\n\t<div class='bbcode_mediaWrap clearfix'>\n\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/album\/18234-playacar-palace\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18234\/tn_gallery_287113_18234_205987.jpg' class='sharedmedia_screenshot cover_img_75' title='Screen Shot 2016 07 06 At 5.46.13 PM'  width='75' height='75'  alt='Screen Shot 2016 07 06 At 5.46.13 PM' id='tn_image_view_84303_cover' \/><\/a>\n\t\t<div class='details'>\n\t\t\t<h5><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/album\/18234-playacar-palace\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>Album: Playacar Palace<\/a><\/h5>\n\t\t\t<div>15 images<\/div>\n\t\t\t<div>0 comments<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<br \/><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span>Saludos<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span><b>Virginia Hermosillo<\/b><\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Dream Art \u00a0Wedding Photography<\/b><\/p>\n<p><span><span>contact<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:vhermosillo@dreamartphotography.com'>@dreamartphotography.com<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span>Tel: +(52) 998 246-5657<\/span><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/weddings.dreamartphotography.com'>http:\/\/weddings.dreamartphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><img src=\"http:\/\/weddings.dreamartphotography.com\/images\/wedding-logo-moto.png\" alt=\"wedding-logo-moto.png\"><\/p>\n<p><span>\u00a0<\/span>","Email":"contact@dreamartphotography.com","IpAddress":"189.221.43.89","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1465498401,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287113.jpg?_r=1468395324","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"DreamArtPhotography","Id":287113,"Name":"DreamArtPhotography","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":14,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
