            <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I will recommend this company that is very serious and offer very good services.<\/p>\n<p>She takes care of all the wedding planning.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>heaventourstravel@yahoo.com<\/p>\n<p>404-647-1009<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mferreiras@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"179.52.147.58","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1468187509,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"maitte28","Id":287329,"Name":"maitte28","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.221.36.247","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80182,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8dbd5765a3c63c94a134d4aed99668ae","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Mymy30\"] have you thought about working with a TA, they can help you narrow down your options.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy Planning&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914833,"PostDate":1468369625,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287321\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/287321-mymy30\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Mymy30<\/span><\/a> have you thought about working with a TA, they can help you narrow down your options.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection! Supporting you brides and help you feel less overwhelmed during the wedding planning process.<\/p>\n<p>Have fun the best is yet to come!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is where I will be posting all videos about most common question about Destination wedding<\/p>\n<p> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html\">http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326857987,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.190.194.12","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80182,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cda305e4c4e6c50c6ba29e836c5e3248","RawContent":"[quote name=\"dreamweddings\" post=\"1914833\" timestamp=\"1468366025\"]\n@[member=\"Mymy30\"] have you thought about working with a TA, they can help you narrow down your options.\n\nHappy Planning[\/quote]Ok thanks, yes I&#039;ve considered getting a TA.  \n\nSent from my SM-N900V using Tapatalk\n[quote name=\"maitte28\" post=\"1914763\" timestamp=\"1468185373\"]\nHi\n\nI will recommend this company that is very serious and offer very good services.\nShe takes care of all the wedding planning.\n\nheaventourstravel@yahoo.com\n404-647-1009[\/quote]Thanks\n\nSent from my SM-N900V using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1914835,"PostDate":1468371483,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>dreamweddings, on Today, 12:27 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287321\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/287321-mymy30\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Mymy30<\/span><\/a> have you thought about working with a TA, they can help you narrow down your options.<br><br>\nHappy Planning<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nOk thanks, yes I've considered getting a TA.  <br><br>\nSent from my SM-N900V using Tapatalk<br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>maitte28, on 10 July 2016 - 10:16 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Hi<br><br>\nI will recommend this company that is very serious and offer very good services.<br>\nShe takes care of all the wedding planning.<br><br>\nheaventourstravel@yahoo.com<br>\n404-647-1009<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nThanks<br><br>\nSent from my SM-N900V using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"maisha.bivins@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.190.194.12","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1468023416,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Mymy30","Id":287321,"Name":"Mymy30","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.11.160.33","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80182,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by DLW0409, Today, 01:53 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1468374836,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"43d372113b7f611bb54f483941ff94b9","RawContent":"Check out Beaches Ocho Rios.  I&#039;ve never been there, but I have a friend who got married there and was really happy. This resort allows kids. I&#039;ve only been to Secrets and Couples, which are adults only, so can&#039;t help recommend a kid friendly resorts. I looked up Beaches when we were planning our wedding and remember that the wedding packages were pretty good. A good Travel Agent can probably help you narrow down the choices based on what is important to you. Once we wrote down all the things we wanted and narrowed down the resorts, it was a pretty easy decision.\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1914836,"PostDate":1468374351,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Check out Beaches Ocho Rios.  I've never been there, but I have a friend who got married there and was really happy. This resort allows kids. I've only been to Secrets and Couples, which are adults only, so can't help recommend a kid friendly resorts. I looked up Beaches when we were planning our wedding and remember that the wedding packages were pretty good. A good Travel Agent can probably help you narrow down the choices based on what is important to you. Once we wrote down all the things we wanted and narrowed down the resorts, it was a pretty easy decision.<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dariaw15@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.11.160.33","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1453669276,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"DLW0409","Id":286024,"Name":"DLW0409","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"80182","Title":"Wedding","LastPostDate":1468374351},"Pages":{"TotalItems":6,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
