CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6365,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d8321d1ad38753f7cc0f81ee23d3bbe5","RawContent":"This question is for everyone? I&#039;m curious to see what you spent on just your invitations, whether you made them yourself or had them professionally done.\n \n Thanks for your help.","Attachments":[],"Id":108025,"PostDate":1189559054,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                This question is for everyone? I'm curious to see what you spent on just your invitations, whether you made them yourself or had them professionally done.<br \/> <br \/> Thanks for your help.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.JenandBrendanWedding.com\">Our Wedding Website<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t20073\">NYJen's Wedding Summary<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jenlmcf725@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1181267196,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207448.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NYJen","Id":207448,"Name":"NYJen","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6365,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6d267b1395ea89a6c443e409b61c1c94","RawContent":"I plan on making them myself (rather simple) and spending around $200 for 200 of them including the $41 in postage.","Attachments":[],"Id":108027,"PostDate":1189559141,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I plan on making them myself (rather simple) and spending around $200 for 200 of them including the $41 in postage.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>~Trisha~<\/p>\n<p>Destination Wedding Photographer & Travel Agent<br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.faberphotography.com\">www.faberphotography.com<\/a>\u00a0-\u00a0My latest destination wedding photos can be found\u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/faberphotography.com\/destination-wedding\/\">HERE<\/a><br><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(0,128,128);\"><strong>Disney Specialist\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">\u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/\" title=\"\"><strong>Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\">\u00a0<br><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/\" title=\"External link\">Looking for a travel agent that KNOWS DISNEY?<\/a><\/span><\/strong><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\">\u00a0 We are an award winning travel agency and you can\u00a0<\/span><strong><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/\" title=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\">Palace Resorts Winner \"Top Travel Agent\", \"Top Homebased Travel Agency\" PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 | \u00a0<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0| \u00a0<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator |\u00a0<strong><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/\" title=\"\">Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/a>\u00a0|\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 | \u00a0 <\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><br><span><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17612\/sml_gallery_206696_17612_13451.png\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17612_13451.png\"><\/span><span><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"><\/span>\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0<span><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"><strong><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010\" title=\"\">Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(178,34,34);\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com\" title=\"External link\">ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"trisha@wrighttravelagency.com","IpAddress":"12.24.226.126","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1172009700,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207201.jpg?_r=1452788764","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":296,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TATrisha","Id":207201,"Name":"TATrisha","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6365,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"39393a976051659d5b649d5c5c1735e5","RawContent":"Considering I&#039;m not married I spent $0 on my invites. LOL. I think I would def have them done but that is only b\/c I am terrible at DIY. I think the most I would spend on an invite is $10 (but even that is a bit much). It would all depend on how much I really loved the invite.","Attachments":[],"Id":108028,"PostDate":1189559211,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Considering I'm not married I spent $0 on my invites. LOL. I think I would def have them done but that is only b\/c I am terrible at DIY. I think the most I would spend on an invite is $10 (but even that is a bit much). It would all depend on how much I really loved the invite.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"vanitysmuf@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1166589060,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206982.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":66,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Nrvsbride","Id":206982,"Name":"Nrvsbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6365,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"50e9b39fdb67105feb079b48c73807d2","RawContent":"I feel like I am the resident cheapass of the board, but I spent about $280 on 100 invitations, if I remember correctly. Got them thru costco and einvite. They were kinda boring but so simple and easy and never a headache.","Attachments":[],"Id":108029,"PostDate":1189559259,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I feel like I am the resident cheapass of the board, but I spent about $280 on 100 invitations, if I remember correctly. Got them thru costco and einvite. They were kinda boring but so simple and easy and never a headache.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"janet.daly@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.33.145.106","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1138267740,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206713.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":288,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Janet","Id":206713,"Name":"Janet","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6365,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c2e7be2f1c753a06ae50c34ee2bc4950","RawContent":"We have spent approx $42.99 on ours, we have had to get them from the states so with the exchange rate being so good, it probably works out to roughly \u00a322-\u00a323. very cheap but we have yet to see what they look like and what we need to do to send them out.\n \n Valerie","Attachments":[],"Id":108047,"PostDate":1189560910,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We have spent approx $42.99 on ours, we have had to get them from the states so with the exchange rate being so good, it probably works out to roughly \u00a322-\u00a323. very cheap but we have yet to see what they look like and what we need to do to send them out.<br \/> <br \/> Valerie\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i272.photobucket.com\/albums\/jj196\/valerieanns\/Wedding\/diana_0305-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i272.photobucket.com\/albums\/j...ana_0305-1.jpg<\/a><br><br><span>Photo's of the wedding can be found at:<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.whocares100.vivaciti.net\/photostore\/Toby\/weddingalbum\/index.html\">http:\/\/www.whocares100.vivaciti.net\/...bum\/index.html<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;131\/st\/20080710\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/5\/k\/721c\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...721c\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"valeriestapley@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1187747774,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207659.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":75,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vale","Id":207659,"Name":"vale","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6365,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d8f43b5e9fcba1ce3341c17a9daa2b7a","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;vale&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;We have spent approx $42.99 on ours, we have had to get them from the states so with the exchange rate being so good, it probably works out to roughly \u00a322-\u00a323. very cheap but we have yet to see what they look like and what we need to do to send them out.\n \n Valerie&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Are these professionally printed invitations? How many did you order? Where did you get them from?\n \n Thanks for your help.","Attachments":[],"Id":108049,"PostDate":1189560974,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>vale<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">We have spent approx $42.99 on ours, we have had to get them from the states so with the exchange rate being so good, it probably works out to roughly \u00a322-\u00a323. very cheap but we have yet to see what they look like and what we need to do to send them out.<br \/> <br \/> Valerie<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Are these professionally printed invitations? How many did you order? Where did you get them from?<br \/> <br \/> Thanks for your help.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.JenandBrendanWedding.com\">Our Wedding Website<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t20073\">NYJen's Wedding Summary<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jenlmcf725@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1181267196,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207448.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NYJen","Id":207448,"Name":"NYJen","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6365,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"41512c4f1d6850eb64828ca16644d8fd","RawContent":"i made them myself - so it&#039;s hard to total the cost. i bought the paper, envelopes, and stamps - it had to have been less than $100","Attachments":[],"Id":108051,"PostDate":1189561029,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                i made them myself - so it's hard to total the cost. i bought the paper, envelopes, and stamps - it had to have been less than $100\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/anns-annr-las-caletas-dreams-pv-hawaii-review-looooooong-6068\/'>Ann's Caletas Wedding & Hawaii Honeymoon Review<\/a><br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.leighmillerphotography.com\/darkroom\/share\/?n=ann_paul'>Our Caletas Wedding Slideshow (by Leigh Miller)<\/a><br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.onetruemedia.com\/shared?p=31de360c85cec8376c35a5&skin_id=701&utm_source=otm&utm_medium=image'>Our Caletas Wedding Video<\/a>","Email":"annkherrick@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"76.16.7.43","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1161392880,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206863.jpg?_r=1429384252","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LCBride2007","Id":206863,"Name":"LCBride2007","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6365,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"32f714146f5fdd565d9edf963adf6572","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;akh&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;i made them myself - so it&#039;s hard to total the cost. i bought the paper, envelopes, and stamps - it had to have been less than $100&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Wow - how many did you make? Did you post a pic of them on here?","Attachments":[],"Id":108054,"PostDate":1189561165,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>akh<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">i made them myself - so it's hard to total the cost. i bought the paper, envelopes, and stamps - it had to have been less than $100<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Wow - how many did you make? Did you post a pic of them on here?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.JenandBrendanWedding.com\">Our Wedding Website<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t20073\">NYJen's Wedding Summary<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jenlmcf725@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1181267196,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207448.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NYJen","Id":207448,"Name":"NYJen","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6365,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"47317d9fd190be1694dcffc7b3b450d6","RawContent":"We spent way to much, the total was somewhere between $500-$550 for 75 invites including postage which looking back I should have gotten them cheaper. \n I was kind of in a jam and needed to order and get them out ASAP because our resort fills up so quickly and there are a few wedding the same week as mine. I spent a couple of hours looking on line and got so fed up that I said screw it and just went with the ones I thought looked nice, could fit all of our travel info on them, and were easiest to order online. \n I would not do this again though.","Attachments":[],"Id":108056,"PostDate":1189561326,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We spent way to much, the total was somewhere between $500-$550 for 75 invites including postage which looking back I should have gotten them cheaper. <br \/> I was kind of in a jam and needed to order and get them out ASAP because our resort fills up so quickly and there are a few wedding the same week as mine. I spent a couple of hours looking on line and got so fed up that I said screw it and just went with the ones I thought looked nice, could fit all of our travel info on them, and were easiest to order online. <br \/> I would not do this again though.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>My Dreams Cabo Wedding Review<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t22576\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t22576<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"Ryjaxs19@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1159324980,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206835.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":75,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jackie","Id":206835,"Name":"Jackie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6365,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2b2e132b1a29cfe9ce1dac0788de77df","RawContent":"we&#039;re doing message in a bottle invites...so far i&#039;d say about $140 for 60 glass invites and extra material (bottles, paper, sand, etc) to spare...shipping will be the rough part, but can&#039;t imagine costing more than $1.00\/invite.","Attachments":[],"Id":108057,"PostDate":1189561380,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                we're doing message in a bottle invites...so far i'd say about $140 for 60 glass invites and extra material (bottles, paper, sand, etc) to spare...shipping will be the rough part, but can't imagine costing more than $1.00\/invite.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lmabramson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.35.229.201","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1183021140,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207500.png?_r=1429371730","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"1elephant","Id":207500,"Name":"1elephant","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"6365","Title":"How much did you spend on your invitations?","LastPostDate":1467228836},"Pages":{"TotalItems":103,"TotalPages":11,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":100},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
